## 4. Cart System (User Side)

### [NEW] [CartController.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/cozzy/app/Http/Controllers/CartController.php)

| Method | Route | Deskripsi |
|--------|-------|-----------|
| [index()](file:///c:/laragon/www/cozzy/app/Http/Controllers/ProductController.php#12-18) | `GET /cart` | Tampilkan isi keranjang |
| [store()](file:///c:/laragon/www/cozzy/app/Http/Controllers/ProductController.php#50-78) | `POST /cart/add` | Tambah item (upsert quantity) |
| [update()](file:///c:/laragon/www/cozzy/app/Http/Controllers/ProductController.php#86-119) | `PATCH /cart/{id}` | Update quantity |
| [destroy()](file:///c:/laragon/www/cozzy/app/Http/Controllers/ProductController.php#120-131) | `DELETE /cart/{id}` | Hapus item dari cart |

```php
// Contoh: Atomic Upsert
public function store(Request $request)
{
    $request->validate(['product_id' => 'required|exists:products,id', 'quantity' => 'required|integer|min:1']);

    Cart::updateOrCreate(
        ['user_id' => auth()->id(), 'product_id' => $request->product_id],
        ['quantity' => DB::raw("quantity + {$request->quantity}")]
    );

    return back()->with('success', 'Produk ditambahkan ke keranjang!');
}
```

