## 5. Checkout System (Multi-Item + Midtrans)

### [NEW] [CheckoutController.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/cozzy/app/Http/Controllers/CheckoutController.php) (Refactor)

**Alur Checkout:**
1. User klik "Checkout" dari cart → tampilkan review page
2. User konfirmasi → create Order + OrderItems atomically
3. Panggil Midtrans Snap API → dapatkan `snap_token`
4. Redirect user ke Midtrans payment page
5. Midtrans callback/notification → update status ke "Paid"

```php
public function process(Request $request)
{
    $user = auth()->user();
    $cartItems = Cart::where('user_id', $user->id)->with('product')->get();

    if ($cartItems->isEmpty()) {
        return back()->with('error', 'Keranjang kosong.');
    }

    DB::beginTransaction();
    try {
        $totalPrice = 0;
        $orderNumber = Order::generateOrderNumber();

        $order = Order::create([
            'user_id'          => $user->id,
            'order_number'     => $orderNumber,
            'shipping_address' => $request->shipping_address ?? $user->address,
            'total_price'      => 0,
            'status'           => 'Pending',
            'payment_method'   => 'midtrans',
        ]);

        foreach ($cartItems as $item) {
            $product = Product::where('id', $item->product_id)->lockForUpdate()->first();

            if ($product->stock < $item->quantity) {
                throw new \Exception("Stok {$product->name} tidak cukup.");
            }

            OrderItem::create([
                'order_id'   => $order->id,
                'product_id' => $product->id,
                'quantity'   => $item->quantity,
                'price'      => $product->price,
            ]);

            $product->decrement('stock', $item->quantity);
            $totalPrice += $product->price * $item->quantity;
        }

        $order->update(['total_price' => $totalPrice]);

        // Log order history
        OrderHistory::create([
            'order_id'    => $order->id,
            'status'      => 'Pending',
            'description' => 'Pesanan dibuat, menunggu pembayaran.',
            'actor'       => 'system',
        ]);

        // Midtrans Snap Token
        $snapToken = $this->createMidtransTransaction($order);
        $order->update(['snap_token' => $snapToken, 'midtrans_order_id' => $orderNumber]);

        // Clear cart
        Cart::where('user_id', $user->id)->delete();

        DB::commit();

        return view('store.payment', compact('order', 'snapToken'));

    } catch (\Exception $e) {
        DB::rollBack();
        return back()->with('error', $e->getMessage());
    }
}
```

