## 13. Implementation Order (Fase)

| Fase | Scope | Estimasi |
|------|-------|----------|
| **1** | Migrations + Models + Relationships | 1 sesi |
| **2** | User Auth (Breeze) + Admin Auth Guard | 1 sesi |
| **3** | Cart System (CRUD) + Views | 1 sesi |
| **4** | Refactor Checkout (multi-item + atomic) | 1 sesi |
| **5** | Midtrans Integration (Snap + Callback) | 1-2 sesi |
| **6** | Order Timeline (order_histories + views) | 1 sesi |
| **7** | WhatsApp Service (Fonnte) + Bulk Actions | 1 sesi |
| **8** | PDF Invoice (DomPDF) | 1 sesi |
| **9** | Admin Dashboard KPI Refresh + UI Polish | 1 sesi |

