### Manual Verification
1. Register user → login → add to cart → checkout → Midtrans payment
2. Admin bulk update status → verify WA message sent
3. Midtrans callback → verify PDF generated & WA sent
4. User profile → verify order timeline display
5. Browser test admin orders page → verify checkboxes & bulk action form
